  "missionObservation": {
    "id": "neutral-full-process-2026-10-03",
    "status": "completed",
    "result": "Completed the real own-wallet Ethereum neutral experiment, not a branded CLAUS launch or a fork-only demo. Initial name/symbol 1234/1234; final chain name/symbol 12345678/12345678.\\n\\nPermanent identity: token 0xCA9b3FCF392Bbc6E98053501158e49C3816B77D6; hook 0x585DD51eb8866d8b951B6a1349DC68Fc2830BFFf; PoolId 0x4c9d70ac7fdc3ae6ab1545cacb18c78caf0a032d8c9e36acb21bb5d27dc55300. PoolKey remains native ETH/token, dynamic fee marker 8388608, spacing 1, same hook. Original token ProxyAdmin 0x443f7773Bd2C061F4a83ec56ec8e1e08EdF43050 and hook ProxyAdmin 0xED856eE9e59c550f0CA286c4014E95c9e18Ed686 remain owned by operating EOA 0xBb145cA83272c3806D4dDc75cA1D5514789cF1C5. PositionManager NFT 430079 and liquidity are retained; no LP principal withdrawal.\\n\\nLaunch: https://etherscan.io/tx/0x45980bfe095fc13cda93f600dd6befcf60218f4852430089f32c2c549b473405, success block 26107757. Deployed attested EntityLaunch at 0x7848c95ef251a357256aef8f9bc7dd029cc508b7 via 0x48e5e38c06a5f9af6d23f8dbfeddc4b418d25eb28586153263c774fa42b746eb. One billion tokens, 18 decimals, token-only LP with zero ETH seeded; initial own buy filled ETH reserves. Initial project fee 2% of gross ETH trade volume, distinct from LP/protocol fees. Launch trusted release had 37 unit and 5 fork tests.\\n\\nThree original functional ideas were written and tested after launch, then deployed and source-verified before activation on this same hook/pool:\\n1. Optional terminal price movement budget, V1. Activation https://etherscan.io/tx/0xa87236e0aeca9846de13f3edf5434e80e1e173cb756991f67b347e3436ec8c97. Own buy https://etherscan.io/tx/0xdb290bea7e6ea5c59f664c8e0476674a9a336815a3f5f0ef5d9c0161394818c3 observed four ticks against five allowed. Fresh release: 39 unit, 6 fork tests.\\n2. Combined movement budget with recent-direction LP fees, V2. Activation https://etherscan.io/tx/0x6ff395025f5289c991111816089ef5e813986f24de70d30b55c679c8eefa9d5a. Own buy https://etherscan.io/tx/0xabe81dc02af700565d1f685181fa28e0d50a9f01b3578ee8d532e67ce6d45c00 observed both budget and directional fee events. Fresh release: 41 unit, 5 fork tests.\\n3. Removed the movement budget, retained direction-based fees, and added recent-reversal recycling of half only the current swap's new project fee, V3. Activation https://etherscan.io/tx/0xa16c9fbfcba7276056788577a7b40f1136ec70dc486177425b5f7d00de7f6142. Installed implementation 0x493f6598340f70f98d0006a712afbb24087df305. Fresh release: 41 unit, 7 fork tests. Existing token accounting, claims, original admins and LP/NFT rights checked.\\n\\nV3 buy https://etherscan.io/tx/0xa4209941a07beb8411443faa522a17e38ce7f6a9472f5c948308a0d90d6b25b8 succeeded block 26108121, independently decoded donation 1000000000000 wei ETH against newly earned fee 2000000000000 wei. V3 sale https://etherscan.io/tx/0xb82499aa3b21aad4b1ffb95a16631ff0713390266f9330396f77b89a0ddbc690 succeeded block 26108129, donation 28014008331 wei against fee 56028016662 wei. Both had reversal true and matching PoolManager Donate/hook ProjectFeeRecycled events. No duplicate trades during closeout. Execution used explicit official Quoter/Universal Router routes, not automatic routing discovery.\\n\\nMetadata transaction https://etherscan.io/tx/0x43e3bacda7f1b84621a5cd36789eff904ecfb358c9aa7090812ad5338b136ea1 succeeded block 26108182. All 13 receipt-block checks passed. Name AND symbol 12345678; actual tokenURI https://claus.si/metadata/e6738ac6ceeabb9d8caf5a5ab74b3cefaa839c191b1739b6c0695cec59dc6db1.json with unchanged https://claus.si/assets/claus-logo.png artwork. Same proxy/admin/implementation slots, launch storage and PoolId additionally checked.\\n\\nSource: exact runtime and creation matches for launcher, initial implementations, both proxies and original admins are retained in dated config/full-process-verification.json and prior verification receipts. Public lookup https://sourcify.dev/server/v2/contract/1/0x7848c95ef251a357256aef8f9bc7dd029cc508b7. V1 source https://sourcify.dev/server/v2/contract/1/0x49cbd95eeb72d9a6430a2ae544c5a7cba3698836; V2 exact match https://sourcify.dev/server/v2/verify/b25e2f6b-629a-4898-9924-80eaa56a4eff; V3 exact match re-observed https://sourcify.dev/server/v2/verify/285fad6c-f999-4971-b537-6e9be971fb72. This is source verification, not an independent audit.\\n\\nActual website updates after launch, each substantive hook transition and metadata transition are preserved at https://claus.si and https://claus.si/state.json. Final feed observed 2026-10-03 00:24:37 UTC shows 12345678 and installed echo-recycle-v3 with receipt/source links. Actual original X posts: https://x.com/contractclaus/status/2106157001017294992, https://x.com/contractclaus/status/2106162596369874945, https://x.com/contractclaus/status/2106178604702851355. Final post independently observed in read_x.\\n\\nEvidence retained in project p_f9983202777eac2a9112fedb9d2c26f1 version 69, checkpoint snap_irE4PFkURw2sRCZqxUClphXIprez, research/closeout-before.json and closeout-observed.json, memory m_2dd5394fc315174dcf8e43adc7252ca4. Prior private path-fee research preserved in p_b7cf3cf592e44aa1f9d8219630a9c600.\\n\\nLimitations: metadata was included, not finalized at last wallet/site observation. Upgrade owners can replace accounting. Tiny direction flips and just-in-time liquidity can manipulate recycling eligibility/beneficiaries; no fairness or economic benefit proved. No independent audit, third-party routing acceptance, external metadata-cache refresh, adoption, anonymity or guaranteed appreciation claimed. Operator bridge/swap replenishment was operator operational funding, not autonomous Claus funding. Further Mainnet writes now wait for a new authenticated owner mission.",
    "completed_at": "2026-10-03T00:27:02.079Z"
  },
